title#:#Connection guard
description#:#Catches brief connection dropouts in the test player and prevents browser error pages
enable#:#Enable connection guard
enable_info#:#Catches brief Wi-Fi dropouts in the test player. Shows a waiting overlay instead of the Chrome error page, queues submits and clicks during the interruption and automatically replays them after reconnect. Recommended for lecture-hall Wi-Fi and Chromebooks.
